@host = http://localhost:5001

### add text to clipboard
POST {{host}}/api/clipboard
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "text": "test"
}

### upload a file（改 path 为本地真实文件；`<` 表示从文件读取内容）
POST {{host}}/api/files/upload
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----TransApp

------TransApp
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="hello.txt"
Content-Type: text/plain

< ./test.txt
------TransApp--

### upload an image（改 path 为本地真实图片；`<` 表示从文件读取内容）
POST {{host}}/api/images/upload
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----TransApp

------TransApp
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="image"; filename="photo.png"
Content-Type: image/png

< ./photo.png
------TransApp--